diff --git a/docs/env_switches.tsv b/docs/env_switches.tsv
index 0766db58..759f4cd3 100644
--- a/docs/env_switches.tsv
+++ b/docs/env_switches.tsv
@@ -745,6 +745,7 @@ DM_VK_STORAGE_FIRST_USE	switch	`=0` (Android): an uncompressed texture whose fir
 DM_VK_STRETCH	player	`1` (Android, live, off) the game's picture is stretched over the whole window instead of fitted with its aspect ratio kept (`vka_present_fit.h`); Game settings › Display › Stretch to screen and the in-game panel's Picture › Fit / Stretch set it, per game; the panel's change reaches the running game through `DM_CTL` and the launcher maps touches to the same rectangle
 DM_VK_SUBGROUP_GS	switch	`0` / `1` (Android, restart) `0`: the geometry stage runs one-lane subgroups; `1`: as the device reports; default 0 on Turnip (which computes subgroup operations wrong there), 1 on other drivers
 DM_VK_SUBGROUP_PIN	switch	`=<stage mask>` (Android, restart, default 1 = every stage that can) the stages (`VkShaderStageFlags`) whose subgroup size is pinned to the shader library's; `0` none
+DM_VK_SUBGROUP_SMALL	switch	`0` / `1` (Android, restart; default 1 on the Xclipse's drivers, RADV and Samsung's, 0 on other drivers) pin the smallest subgroup size the shader library is right for (32) instead of the largest (64) [NOVA]
 DM_VK_SWAP_RB	diagnostic	`=<n>` the present's red/blue swap (`vka_present.c vka_swap_rb`; default the profile's `DM_GAME_SWAP_RB`, else 0)
 DM_VK_SYNCLOG	diagnostic	`=<n>` (Android, live, 0 = off) logs the game's next n waits together with each submission's recording and queueing times and timestamp reports (`sync …` lines, one clock in ms)
 DM_VK_TABLE_POOL	switch	[PEANUTS] `0` (Android, restart, default 1) keeps a texture array over a table of handles in a uniform buffer as the library has it, 32 elements with the index clamped; by default such a module reads the table's handles itself and takes their textures from the texture pool (`vka_shader.c` `tabpool`, [shaders.md](reference/shaders.md#a-table-of-handles-longer-than-the-translators-32-element-array-android))
